    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you go from dusty streets to global superstardom?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0<strong>Favela Kick: The Final Goal</strong>, you are a young boy born into poverty in Brazil with nothing but a dream and a talent for football. This is your story, your journey.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Dream:</strong> Start as a kid playing in the favelas, get scouted, and rise through the ranks of Brazilian football.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Europe:</strong> Make your mark in the big leagues of France, England, and Spain. Can you become a world-class star?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome Adversity:</strong> The path to glory is never easy. Face unexpected challenges and tough decisions that could change everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achieve Glory:</strong> Lift your family out of hardship, chase the biggest trophies in club football, and fight for the ultimate honor with the Brazilian national team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Legacy Awaits:</strong> Experience the highs and lows of a football legend's career. Every match, every goal, every decision shapes your path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story-driven gameplay with impactful cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your player through multiple leagues and countries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dramatic moments of triumph and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, heartfelt pixel art style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your final kick be the one that defines a generation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey from nothing to legend starts now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localized to: English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, Italian, Indonesian, German, Turkish, Greek, Russian.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you go from dusty streets to global superstardom?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the\u00a0<strong>Favela Kick: The Final Goal</strong>, you are a young boy born into poverty in Brazil with nothing but a dream and a talent for football. This is your story, your journey.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Dream:</strong> Start as a kid playing in the favelas, get scouted, and rise through the ranks of Brazilian football.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Europe:</strong> Make your mark in the big leagues of France, England, and Spain. Can you become a world-class star?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome Adversity:</strong> The path to glory is never easy. Face unexpected challenges and tough decisions that could change everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achieve Glory:</strong> Lift your family out of hardship, chase the biggest trophies in club football, and fight for the ultimate honor with the Brazilian national team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Legacy Awaits:</strong> Experience the highs and lows of a football legend's career. Every match, every goal, every decision shapes your path.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story-driven gameplay with impactful cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress your player through multiple leagues and countries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dramatic moments of triumph and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, heartfelt pixel art style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your final kick be the one that defines a generation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey from nothing to legend starts now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localized to: English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, Italian, Indonesian, German, Turkish, Greek, Russian.</p>",
